+/**
+ * Short setup (Drift perpetual) — the mirror of the long rules: 4h downtrend,
+ * 1h bounce that is fading (RSI 32-65, momentum turning down), stop above the
+ * nearest resistance, target at the next 4h swing low, reward/risk >= 2.
